<title>USA: BankAtlantic Bancorp sets stock split.</title>
<headline>BankAtlantic Bancorp sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAtlantic Bancorp said Wednesday it has set a five-for-four stock split.</p>
<p>The split is to be effected in the form of a 25 percent common stock dividend payable in Class A stock to holders of BankAtlantic Class A and Class B common stock as of February 17.</p>
<p>The split is payable on March 4.</p>
</text>
